OL,3,GNEWSASon jailed for strangling mum to
OL,4,Afuel drug habit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who strangled his mother to death
OL,7,Fat their east London home after
OL,8,Fstealing from her to buy drugs has been
OL,9,Fjailed for life.
OL,11,FRichard Clayton, 45, admitted murdering
OL,12,FAngela Clayton, 74, in the early hours
OL,13,Fof 17 February at the house they shared
OL,14,Fin Newham.
OL,16,FSentencing him at the Old Bailey on
OL,17,FMonday, Judge Nigel Lickley KC called
OL,18,FClayton "despicable", "callous" and
OL,19,F"self-centred" and told him he must
OL,20,Fserve at least 22 years before he can
OL,21,Fbe considered for release.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
