OL,3,GNEWSASon jailed for strangling mum to
OL,4,Afuel drug habit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe court heard Clayton had taken money
OL,7,Fand belongings from his mother to pay
OL,8,Ffor cannabis and cocaine, both before
OL,9,Fand after he killed her.
